    {
      "id": "4B6CC6FE5FA6E636",
      "title": "World bubble coordinate analysis center",
      "subtitle": "Industrial equipment·Building materials samples",
      "description": [
        "\"Get the controller of this device and get the AE template filled with building materials and quantities.\"",
        "\"The building materials list can be re-received here after it is updated. Please replace the old template in the supplier with the new template.\"",
        "\"Place the pattern into the pattern feeder facing the individual stocking container and turn off the feeder's automatic pattern expansion. Order 1 copy per sheet and continue to free up space for receiving materials.\"",
        "\"After all materials are received, cancel the order waiting for the material list and release the synthesis CPU. Do not receive the same AE inventory back to the material preparation container.\"",
        "\"The model contains the main building materials; the input and output warehouses, energy warehouses, etc. are configured according to the actual process. The controller has been obtained and will not be included again.\"",
        "\"The template only writes building materials that can be converted into items; end portals, piston heads, and other items without items will not enter the AE order. The upper half of the door will not be counted repeatedly, and the double-decker steps will be counted as two pieces.\"",
        "\"Please prepare a storage container with sufficient capacity according to the quantity of building materials. Large buildings need to store millions or even more blocks.\""
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "4B6519B798525112",
